{"id":"n81895-1-8","stage":5,"title":"철새 · 候鸟","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n81895-1-8-1","ko":"제비는 왜 겨울에는 우리나라에 없는 거지?","zh":"为什么燕子在冬天会不在我们国家呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제비는","meaning":"燕子","explanation":"제비：燕子；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"제비","audio":"/audio/2f40281eb74647249b81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31790","senseId":"1","lemma":"제비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"겨울에는","meaning":"冬天，冬季","explanation":"겨울：冬天，冬季；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"겨울","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64367","senseId":"1","lemma":"겨울","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리나라에","meaning":"我们，咱们；国，国家","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；나라：国，国家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"},{"term":"나라","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"29699","senseId":"1","lemma":"나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"8","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f40281eb7464724","term":"제비","zh":"燕子","audio":"/audio/2f40281eb74647249b81.mp3","entryId":"31790","definition":"一种飞行速度极快的小型夏季候鸟，背部为黑色，肚子是白色，春天飞来韩国，冬天飞向南方。","pronunciation":["제ː비"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"ac9e69428d653c8c","term":"겨울","zh":"冬天，冬季","audio":"/audio/ac9e69428d653c8c2b15.mp3","entryId":"64367","definition":"四季中的一个，介于秋天和春天之间的寒冷的季节。","pronunciation":["겨울"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"02faec8ed1c75703","term":"나라","zh":"国，国家","audio":"/audio/02faec8ed1c75703dcd3.mp3","entryId":"29699","definition":"拥有一定领土与主权的、由居民组成的社会性组织。","pronunciation":["나라"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或动物不停留或生活在某处。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/b434e6db009b25a60e6f.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n81895-1-8-2","ko":"철새라서 추워지면 남쪽으로 날아가거든.","zh":"因为它们是候鸟，天气变冷时就会飞往南方。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"철새라서","meaning":"候鸟","explanation":"철새：候鸟；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"철새","audio":"/audio/2a6baddd628994c0a2a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81895","senseId":"1","lemma":"철새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추워지면","meaning":"冷；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"춥다：冷；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"2","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남쪽으로","meaning":"南侧，南边，南方","explanation":"남쪽：南侧，南边，南方；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"남쪽","audio":"/audio/aa6ac947e28f5dad655c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63619","senseId":"1","lemma":"남쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날아가거든.","meaning":"飞去，飞走","explanation":"날아가다：飞去，飞走；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"날아가다","audio":"/audio/9a5dc997602f95d3a712.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58275","senseId":"1","lemma":"날아가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2a6baddd628994c0","term":"철새","zh":"候鸟","audio":"/audio/2a6baddd628994c0a2a3.mp3","entryId":"81895","definition":"随着季节变化到处迁移的鸟类。","pronunciation":["철쌔"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"大气温度低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"aa6ac947e28f5dad","term":"남쪽","zh":"南侧，南边，南方","audio":"/audio/aa6ac947e28f5dad655c.mp3","entryId":"63619","definition":"四个方位之一，指南针上“S”极所示的方向。","pronunciation":["남쪽"]},{"id":"9a5dc997602f95d3","term":"날아가다","zh":"飞去，飞走","audio":"/audio/9a5dc997602f95d3a712.mp3","entryId":"58275","definition":"在空中飞过去。","pronunciation":["나라가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e17d008ffea14419bfda.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.162,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=81895","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为它们是候鸟，天气变冷时就会飞往南方。","你的存钱罐拿起来可真沉。","为什么燕子在冬天会不在我们国家呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为它们是候鸟，天气变冷时就会飞往南方。","为什么燕子在冬天会不在我们国家呢？","你的存钱罐拿起来可真沉。"],"answer":0}]}
